    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>As a Utilize action, you can spill Ball Bearings from their pouch. They spread to cover a level, 10-foot-square area within 10 feet of yourself. A creature that enters this area for the first time on a turn must succeed on a DC 10 Dexterity saving throw or have the Prone condition. It takes 10 minutes to recover the Ball Bearings.</p><section id=\"secret-bbcC5syRGw0PCZnG\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The <strong>Recover Ball Bearings</strong> activity grants another use of this item.</p></section>",
